{"resourceIdentifier":"2471","resourceName":"Agroforestry and reforestation with small-scale farmers in Uganda","description":"Purpose of the project is to reforest degraded land and promote sustainable agroforestry with small-scale farmers located in coffee and vanilla area in Uganda. PUR Projet is an international organisation specialised in the development of ecosystem restoration within agricultural supply chains like coffee, cocoa and vanilla.\r\nThe main objective of the project are then the following:\r\n-Climate change mitigation throught carbon removals\r\n-Increase climate change resilience of small-holder farmers, diversify incomes and restore ecosystem services by supporting agroforestry practices, inside and around coffee parcels.\r\n-Increase coffee yields and quality by implementing Good Agricultural Practices (GAP).","location":{"latitude":0.169899,"longitude":30.078078},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2021-12-17","endExclusive":"2022-01-17","endInclusive":"2022-01-16"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2471"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Rwenzori"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"The PURE PROJECT SAS"},{"type":"string","value":"Paris, France"},{"type":"string","value":"+56 983 58 42 75"},{"type":"string","value":"carbon@pur.co"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2471"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2471"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1214"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":521}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Agriculture Forestry and Other Land Use"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_SUBCATERGORY_NAMES","values":[{"typ